---
- op: replace
  path: /metadata/name
  value: mcp-hindsight-ops
- op: add
  path: /spec/toolsOverride
  value:
    retain:
      description: >-
        Store incident/RCA memory. Unlike the conversational home bank,
        FACTUAL operational fields are welcome here: alert/event ids,
        timelines, root causes, actions taken, and verification results.
        Still NEVER retain credentials, raw tool dumps, or verbatim log
        payloads; distill first. Tag consistently using existing tags
        (see list_tags).
    recall:
      description: >-
        Search incident memories. Prefer reflect for synthesized answers;
        use recall only when individual incident entries are needed.
